Package: terravars
Title: Terrain, Hydrological and Canopy Indices for Environmental Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Ilya", "Maclean", email = "i.m.d.maclean@exeter.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8030-9136"))
Description: Provides fast computation of topographic and canopy-derived spatial
    predictor variables for statistical microclimate downscaling. Functions
    include solar index, sky-view factor, topographic wetness index (multiple
    methods), wind shelter indices, and two-stream radiation for vegetated
    surfaces. Designed for compatibility with the 'terra' package for raster
    data handling. Core computations are implemented in C++ via 'Rcpp' for
    performance on large spatial datasets.
